message: "If you use HYWE or the HYWE Spatial Configuration Dataset in your research or computational design projects, please cite it as follows."
title: "HYWE: Computational Spatial Design Environment & Benchmark Dataset"
authors:
  - family-names: "Subbaiah"
    given-names: "Vikram"
abstract: "A computational spatial design environment powered by deterministic design computation, integer-lattice spatial topology, and edge-native WebAssembly. HYWE formalizes and explores early-stage architectural spatial configurations from relational graphs, circulation sequences, and programmatic constraints."
